      <p source="#source-20319-21392"><seg source="#source-20319-20322">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20322-20340"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20340-20346">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20346-20358"><rb>生</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20358-20367">きぬく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20367-20385"><rb>力</rb><rt>ちから</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20385-20403">というものを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20403-20418"><rb>感</rb><rt>かん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20418-20445">じました。それは、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20445-20469"><rb>学校</rb><rt>がっこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20469-20478">にいる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20478-20499"><rb>時分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20499-20502">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20502-20526"><rb>先生</rb><rt>せんせい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20526-20535">からも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20535-20547"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20547-20556">いた、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20556-20580"><rb>健康</rb><rt>けんこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20580-20598">で、まじめに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20598-20616"><rb>働</rb><rt>はたら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20616-20646">くということですが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20646-20670"><rb>同窓</rb><rt>どうそう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20670-20673">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20673-20697"><rb>小泉</rb><rt>こいずみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20697-20718">くんについて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20718-20742"><rb>最近</rb><rt>さいきん</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20742-20760"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20760-20763">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" s